msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"You'll never get a girlfriend if you can't even do your\r\n"
"homework by yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey, you two. Are the dishes all done?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Yup, we finished ages ago!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "And have you taken your baths?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh, uh... Not yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I took one before dinner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Well Mitsuo, you'll have to wait until Haruka gets out.\r\n"
"How's your homework coming along?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "I did that before dinner, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "I, uh... Haha... Ha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"I'll take that as a no. You should be more proactive about getting your "
"chores done. Riona did everything before dinner and now she has the rest of "
"the night to just relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "All riiight."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Hey, Riona, think you could help me with my homework since you're sooo free?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Do it yourself! You'll never get a girlfriend with that kind\r\n"
"of attitude."
msgstr ""

